# 35. FINAL PRINCIPLE

The website should not win by having more visual effects.

It should win through:

**clarity + hierarchy + consistency + trust + restraint + excellent interaction design.**

The final result should look like a real professional Android technical-service company built by an experienced product team — not an AI-generated template.

